Description: High-Performance Local File Copy Engine
 HTTransfer is a world-class local file copy engine, similar to
 FastCopy / TeraCopy / Robocopy (GUI version). Core capabilities:
 ultra-large file (TB-level) stable copying, multi-threaded high
 performance, automatic resume, data integrity verification,
 scheduled incremental backup, system tray background running.